WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.671
MOBIUS
You're in a lot of trouble.

00:00:02.696 --> 00:00:03.647
[Loki yells]

00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:05.024
You want to get
out of here, right?

00:00:05.048 --> 00:00:07.048
What if I can
offer you a chance?

00:00:07.415 --> 00:00:09.141
LOKI
And what does my chance require?

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:10.211
MOBIUS
Someone's changing

00:00:10.211 --> 00:00:11.344
the proper flow of time.

00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:14.172
You're here to help
me catch this guy.

00:00:14.172 --> 00:00:14.922
LOKI
Who is it?

00:00:14.922 --> 00:00:16.308
MOBIUS
Someone very familiar.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:18.352
LOKI
You gotta be kidding me.

00:00:18.993 --> 00:00:21.897
MOBIUS
He could be hiding anywhere, anytime.

00:00:25.352 --> 00:00:26.527
LOKI
How nice to meet you.

